msgstr "Tipo di file non consentito"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1153
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1822
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1921
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:2013
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:2113
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:2188
